Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been two months since we left Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's been eight months since the Yamato left Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:02:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,On our journey, we've lost many friends, and there's been much sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have never lost hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's because people on Earth\Nbelieved in us, and were waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.68,0:02:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time we came this way, we were very scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is heading home, carrying hope with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Balun? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! We're using the subspace gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn't we destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.83,0:03:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate back to our galaxy should still be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's well worth checking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That gate will take us 60,000 light years in a single jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use the controller from the last time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... If this works, we can compensate for the time we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reading a possible mayday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This... This is Garmillan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Allied fleet approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Minister Talan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been awaiting your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.19,0:04:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With Desler gone, uniting to rebuild our home will be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.28,0:04:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What worries me is that some ships\Nrebelled and ignored your order to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sent someone I can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time, I, Goer, have led a fleet of 3,000 forward, night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And along the way, we've abandoned those that allied with the traitor Ditz.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And with thirty of my best ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have wandered the infinite galaxies to finally meet you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so greatly overjoyed at{\fnC}—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do you obsess over that ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To turn those who drove me to the brink, into my own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you not think that splendid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The glory of Great Garmillas shall bring order and salvation to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And I alone can make that possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be having engine trouble and can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the medic. We've located survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Approaching now to rescue them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Garmillas officer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She says she knows them, but is sending Mori alone really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.04,0:06:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This has happened before, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Though we were in opposite positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll repair your ship, and you can get back to Garmillas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.66,0:06:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of returning to that planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My home is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the people of Jirel, were telepaths by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of the neighboring planets feared, envied, and destroyed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.22,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mirenel and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.80,0:07:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, but Desler died in that battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't die... He can't die without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp complete. We've arrived at Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.51,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The planet is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It probably couldn't withstand the gravitational shift
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,after the plant at its core was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of debris. Shima, watch the navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Decelerate. Red 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We've sighted the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heading for the Geschtam gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How are the engineers doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmitting power to the system satellite!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But we won't last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You only have to last long\Nenough to get the Yamato through the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Those foolish rats don't know it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We've sighted the subspace gate to our galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no damage to its external structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the gate controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.10,0:08:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating gate controller phase 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They waited among the debris to ambush us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons Officer, counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, deploy the shield. We'll head straight through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,More power to engines!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy is accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're making for the Geschtam Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fallen for it, Yamato! Chase them into the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,0.2 light seconds until we reach the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedoes from the front! They're on a collision course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Allied torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The dimensional submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You ignored Admiral Ditz's command to return,\Nand moved your fleet without orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.15,0:10:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an order for your arrest, General Goer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A military tribunal awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Captain seems to be having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs of Ditz... Fire! Sink them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.81,0:10:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we're ready to dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just yet... Draw them in a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy submarine has passed our port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillans fighting each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let this chance pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward! Accelerate to speed 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.47,0:10:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance gate controller phase 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Heyni, dive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:10:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.28,0:11:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was just getting good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine room to command!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've opened the dimensional emergency valves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost the dimensional submarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The filthy dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves, cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"Cowards," he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.43,0:11:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one to talk, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Goer... Garemud Goer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But that scared me for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a useful guy to have around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The new kid from Zartz?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Captain loves to take in the abandoned dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're returning to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside the subspace corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Steady as she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we lose them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, radar won't work within the gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.58,0:12:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Shima?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know... The helm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to optical combat mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the launch hangar! Enemy troops are inside the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple hostiles on deck 02!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No response from launch hangar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.23,0:13:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Air pressure is dropping inside the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal the bulkheads! Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll command our defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, prepare for boarding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Arm yourselves, and prepare to repel boarders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we can't put you anywhere better, but stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Garmies!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Toyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Iwata! Toyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.87,0:14:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Teams 1 and 2 will take over the engine room!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Send the rest of the troops to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be going well, Talan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to have a word with the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect His Lordship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, there are no life signs among the troops that have boarded us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.64,0:15:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're fighting Garmilloids? Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Garmies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.05,0:16:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tactical Officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai! More boarders on deck 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,More boarders have attacked deck 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Security is to head there at once and eliminate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.95,0:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I call you the false princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's safe! He's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Captain wouldn't meet with the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A strong-willed princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.95,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that upstart Jirel woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She released sympathetic waves the moment she saw him. How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the problem with Jirels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.14,0:18:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! What if you hit the engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She loved you so much... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no need for Earth or Garmillas to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They could've cared for one another...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They could've loved one another!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They could have...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,War is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,To force worlds to obey, and bring salvation to the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And to the sole woman I love...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The woman you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.66,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.68,0:19:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this, Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I always...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Setup complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.52,0:20:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're releasing the lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Wave Motion Core will...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A virus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The mechanical soldiers are out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The data we took before came in handy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We should thank Alter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki! Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.69,0:21:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship, hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Your Lordship"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,His Lordship has returned. We're taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool! Who ordered you to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm s-sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, in this place, normal beam weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.76,0:21:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't work, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Desler Cannon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy ship is falling back! It's at six o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:22:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If it can't use beam weapons, then it's their Wave Motion Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy charge! 90 belas until criticality!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this! Using the Desler Cannon inside the corridor is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere, Talan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.91,0:22:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.66,0:22:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The target is turning around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Energy charge complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the Desler Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Target locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.55,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon shells!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.50,0:22:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is firing at us with cannon shells!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:22:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Barbarians!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600)}I will save the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like I promised you back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.91,0:23:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're through the subspace gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at our galaxy's outer rim!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki... Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.66,0:24:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please Yuki, come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to me, Yuki... Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.97,0:24:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.08,0:27:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,An epic journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.09,0:27:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A long, long voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.36,0:27:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato returns to its home galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.53,0:27:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and its journey is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.33,0:27:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,New life is born as other lives come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.30,0:27:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not goodbye, but a new meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.18,0:27:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming of the green hills of Earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.39,0:27:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Last Episode: Memories of the Blue Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The journey will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:38.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:45.26,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.26,0:24:51.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.05,0:24:53.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.51,0:24:56.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.89,0:25:03.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.44,0:25:08.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.99,0:25:15.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:21.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:27.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.51,0:25:31.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.13,0:25:34.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.10,0:25:35.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.93,0:25:39.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.77,0:25:43.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.44,0:25:46.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.52,0:25:52.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If you have nothing special
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.61,0:25:58.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Only the strength to yearn for it
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.79,0:26:04.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bound to the limits of time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:16.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Create the trace of a miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.06,0:26:32.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.03,0:26:35.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:38.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.70,0:26:40.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:44.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.42,0:26:48.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.04,0:26:50.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.59,0:26:54.22,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.22,0:26:56.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Together with you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.80,0:27:03.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:18.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1291,840)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1922,1493)}Episode 25
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:18.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1291,1073)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1922,1493)}The Forever War
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:51.86,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Who is your commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:16:59.35,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}My my...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:02.04,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}The princess of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.58,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(257,0)\fax0.8\frx7\bord0\fs49.5\blur1.2\c&H605B58&\frz1.191\pos(952.8,458.4)}Chuya Nakahara Poems
